<title>USA: Scientific Measurement says CFO resigns.</title>
<headline>Scientific Measurement says CFO resigns.</headline>
<dateline>AUSTIN, Texas 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scientific Measurement Systems Inc said on Friday that its executive vice president and chief financial officer Gary Kofnovec had resigned.</p>
<p>The company did not elaborate on reasons for the resignation.</p>
<p>SMS develops industrial digital radiography and computed tomography or Catscan imaging.</p>
